<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-1480] INT96 to avro not yet implemented error should mention deprecation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-1480</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Since &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-323&quot; title=&quot;INT96 should be marked as deprecated&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;PARQUET-323&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;PARQUET-323&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, INT96 is marked as deprecated.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In parquet-mr AvroSchemaConverter, the convertINT96 method&#160;throws&#160;an error saying:&#160;&quot;INT96 not yet implemented.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is this likely to be implemented, since INT96 is deprecated? or can we remove the &quot;yet&quot; and return a note of that.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
